	(text "Depending on the build, the ESP32 or the RPi can be left empty.\nWhen both are present, 3 Voltage regulators are needed (3v3, 3v3, 5v)\nWhen only ESP32 is present, 1-2 Voltage regulators are needed (3v3)\nWhen only RİP is present, 2 Voltage regulators are needed (5v, 3v3)\n[theoretically the 3v3 output of the RPi can be used...]\n\nMore importantly the regulators should have enable pins and load disconnects.\nTPS63020s do a good job. The charging circuitry is also open ended.\nInstead of a TP4056 an MH-CD42 module can be used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 302.768 230.632 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "239f9d72-10b7-4b22-91d2-af9b752376d7")
	)
